  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "我在ZA登峰戰有看到<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳就是<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115728005A0041767B5CF062306709770B523000100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF0C000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B35C31662F001000020100000054273002001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "身為一個寶可夢訓練家，\n我是ZA登峰戰的大粉絲。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8EAB70BA4E00500B5BF653EF59228A137DF45BB6FF0C000A6211662F005A0041767B5CF06230768459277C897D723002001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "每次只要想到了新的戰術，\n我就會找ZA登峰戰的訓練家當對手。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6BCF6B2153EA898160F352304E8665B0768462308853FF0C000A62115C316703627E005A0041767B5CF0623076848A137DF45BB675765C0D624B3002001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不過這真是太奇妙了，\n像<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳這樣的小孩子能那麼活躍……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D904E9019771F662F592A594759994E86FF0C000A50CF00100003110000FF01014F6059B390196A2376845C0F5B695B5080FD90A39EBC6D3B8E8D20262026001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "難道是ZA登峰戰的\n水準變低了嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96E39053662F005A0041767B5CF062307684000A6C346E968B8A4F4E4E8655CEFF1F001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就讓我用寶可夢對戰來確認答案吧！\n來！嚐嚐我的戰術！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C318B93621175285BF653EF59225C0D62304F8678BA8A8D7B5468485427FF01000A4F86FF01569056906211768462308853FF01001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳準備好要和我對戰了，\n就告訴我一聲吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B4900100003110000FF01014F6059B36E965099597D8981548C62115C0D62304E86FF0C000A5C31544A8A3462114E0080725427FF01001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要不要嚐嚐我的戰術啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89814E0D8981569056906211768462308853554AFF01001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好啊",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D554A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "才不要呢",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "624D4E0D898154620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "ZA登峰戰的訓練家\n不都是喜歡對戰的嗎？<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n既然如此，<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳為何不願意和我對打！？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005A0041767B5CF0623076848A137DF45BB6000A4E0D90FD662F559C6B615C0D6230768455CEFF1F00100001BE00000A65E2713659826B64FF0C00100003110000FF01014F6059B370BA4F554E0D9858610F548C62115C0D6253FF01FF1F001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "戰鬥中的攻擊\n不僅是給予對手傷害！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62309B254E2D7684653B64CA000A4E0D50C5662F7D664E885C0D624B50B75BB3FF01001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看我這就讓寶可夢帶著樹果……\n欲知其中道理，就在對戰中一探究竟吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B621190195C318B935BF653EF59225E3684576A39679C20262026000A6B3277E551764E2D90537406FF0C5C3157285C0D62304E2D4E0063A27A767ADF5427FF01001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "想不到想不到，\n我這個讓寶可夢攜帶「樹果」的戰術<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n竟然被<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳給破解了……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n讓寶可夢攜帶持有物，\n攜帶的東西就會根據狀況發揮效果呢！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "作為我們的見面禮，\n這橙橙果就送給<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F5C70BA621150117684898B976279AEFF0C000A90196A596A59679C5C3190017D6600100003110000FF01014F6059B354273002001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "攜帶著橙橙果的寶可夢\n在戰鬥中HP低於一半以下時，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n就會吃下橙橙果來回復。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "651C5E3684576A596A59679C76845BF653EF5922000A572862309B254E2D004800504F4E65BC4E00534A4EE54E0B6642FF0C00100001BE00000A5C31670354034E0B6A596A59679C4F8656DE5FA93002001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "以後我要測試戰術時\n就找<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳當對手啦！拜託囉。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
